@startuml FastBite_Seq_Catalogo_Campanhas
title FastBite - Sequencia: Gestao de catalogo, disponibilidade e campanhas

skinparam shadowing false

actor "Gestor da cadeia/restaurante" as Manager
participant "Web Restaurante" as Web
participant "GraphQL\nMenu/Campaign Mutations" as GQL
participant "CategoryService" as CategorySvc
participant "ProductService" as ProductSvc
participant "RestaurantProductService" as RestaurantProductSvc
participant "PromotionService" as PromotionSvc
participant "CouponService" as CouponSvc
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Catalogo da cadeia ==

Manager -> Web: cria categoria
Web -> GQL: mutation createCategory(input)
GQL -> CategorySvc: createCategory(CreateCategoryDTO)
CategorySvc -> DB: insert categories
CategorySvc --> GQL: Category
GQL --> Web: categoria criada

Manager -> Web: cria produto com preco base
Web -> GQL: mutation createProduct(input)
GQL -> ProductSvc: createProduct(CreateProductDTO)
ProductSvc -> DB: insert products
ProductSvc -> DB: insert option groups/options se aplicavel
ProductSvc --> GQL: Product
GQL --> Web: produto criado

== Menu local do restaurante ==

Manager -> Web: adiciona produto ao restaurante
Web -> GQL: mutation createRestaurantProduct(input)
GQL -> RestaurantProductSvc: createRestaurantProduct(dto)
RestaurantProductSvc -> DB: insert restaurant_products
RestaurantProductSvc --> GQL: RestaurantProduct
GQL --> Web: produto disponivel no menu

Manager -> Web: altera disponibilidade/preco local
Web -> GQL: mutation setRestaurantProductAvailability(id, is_available)
GQL -> RestaurantProductSvc: setRestaurantProductAvailability(...)
RestaurantProductSvc -> DB: update restaurant_products
GQL --> Web: menu atualizado

== Campanhas e cupoes ==

Manager -> Web: cria promocao
Web -> GQL: mutation createPromotion(input)
GQL -> PromotionSvc: createPromotion(CreatePromotionDTO)
PromotionSvc -> DB: insert promotions
PromotionSvc -> DB: insert promotion_items
PromotionSvc --> GQL: Promotion
GQL --> Web: promocao ativa

Manager -> Web: cria cupao
Web -> GQL: mutation createCoupon(input)
GQL -> CouponSvc: createCoupon(CreateCouponDTO)
CouponSvc -> DB: insert coupons
CouponSvc -> DB: insert promotion_items quando tem alvos
CouponSvc --> GQL: Coupon
GQL --> Web: cupao disponivel para checkout

@enduml
